<h2 id="writing-a-post">Writing a post</h2>

<p>Create a file in <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">_posts/</code> named <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">YYYY-MM-DD-some-title.md</code>:</p>

<div class="language-markdown highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="nn">---</span>
<span class="na">title</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="s2">"</span><span class="s">My</span><span class="nv"> </span><span class="s">new</span><span class="nv"> </span><span class="s">post"</span>
<span class="na">tags</span><span class="pi">:</span> <span class="pi">[</span><span class="nv">notes</span><span class="pi">]</span>
<span class="nn">---</span>

Write in <span class="gs">**Markdown**</span>. That's it.
</code></pre></div></div>

<p>Push to <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">main</code> and GitHub Pages rebuilds the site in about a minute.</p>

